+{"sections":[{"topic":"authority","conclusion":"The authority system enforces strict ownership boundaries through durable authorization. Main agents and investigators have different permission levels: main agents can create investigators as direct descendants (delegation.py line 159), while investigators are readonly and cannot modify state (delegation.py line 16). Workspace versions and history inheritance are validated during delegation - the policy checks that the investigation spec has valid owner and history inheritance (delegation.py line 158-159), and workspace_id is handled through host policy in provisioning.py (line 34-35). The system uses fresh AgentDirectory snapshots for each authorization decision (authority.py line 58-60), ensuring permissions are always based on current durable state.","evidence":[{"path":"src/traceh/supervision/delegation.py","start_line":158,"end_line":159},{"path":"src/traceh/supervision/authority.py","start_line":58,"end_line":60}]},{"topic":"budget","conclusion":"Budget reservation and management follows a strict pre-commit pattern. Subtasks reserve budget before execution through _start_reserved_usage (enforcement.py line 347-384), with careful handling of cancellation races. The main agent retains a 'close' budget by using _terminalize_cancelled_usage_start (enforcement.py line 281-301) which handles cases where cancellation occurs during START commit. Budget enforcement occurs at multiple layers: Tool admission (enforcement.py line 421-453), continuation runtime (enforcement.py line 461-495), and LLM runtime (enforcement.py line 584-638), ensuring comprehensive coverage.","evidence":[{"path":"src/traceh/budgets/enforcement.py","start_line":347,"end_line":384},{"path":"src/traceh/budgets/enforcement.py","start_line":281,"end_line":301}]},{"topic":"lifecycle","conclusion":"The lifecycle system ensures no running work remains through coordinated disposal scopes and quiescence barriers. Creation/cancellation uses AgentLifecycleCoordinator with admission leases (lifecycle.py line 121-137) and disposal scopes (lifecycle.py line 139-161). Cleanup failures are handled by await_worker_convergence (execution.py line 84-85) which ensures convergence before propagating errors. Main agent termination uses begin_close() and wait_quiescent() (lifecycle.py line 163-171) to ensure all admitted work completes. Products are captured through AgentRunReportReader (reports.py line 29-125) which reconstructs reports solely from durable facts, ensuring results are available even if the original process crashed.","evidence":[{"path":"src/traceh/supervision/lifecycle.py","start_line":121,"end_line":137},{"path":"src/traceh/supervision/reports.py","start_line":29,"end_line":125}]}]}
